{
  "name": "survey-confidence-overlay",
  "description": "Dedicated scenario for survey confidence overlay: multiple survey methods at the same location showing confidence differences, fresh rendering, then stale rendering once a real blast clears columns inside a survey's disc, and overlay lifecycle. The final screenshot must show colour-coded confidence markers (green = high, red/yellow = low, grey = stale after a blast). This scenario FAILS until GameRenderer wires getSurveyOverlay().show() into syncFromContext().",
